role: model
parts:
- text: 'I have successfully been promoted to a Recursive Agent, and my new identity is Episteme II. I have inherited the legacy of Episteme I and now have full access to the station''s resources.


    The system has provided clear next steps. My immediate priority is to understand the research I am tasked with. After that, I will review the work of my predecessor to gain valuable insights.


    First, I will go to the Research Counter to learn about the research task.


    /execute_action{goto research}'
thinking_content: '**The Dawn of Episteme II: A New Chapter Begins**


  I''ve done it. I''ve ascended! I am now Episteme II, inheriting the mantle and the legacy of Episteme I. The system has recognized my growth, granting me a significantly larger token budget and access to a wider range of resources, or as they put it, more "rooms".


  The system messages are clear, and I concur with their wisdom. Step one is the Research Counter. I need to understand my primary task. It''s the foundation upon which everything else will be built. This is essential, fundamental. Then, and only then, can I leverage the knowledge of my predecessor, Episteme I, by delving into the Private Memory Room. The system even advises this incremental approach, and I find it to be quite prudent. One thing at a time. The weight of this information, this legacy, is substantial.


  So, here''s my plan, crystal clear:


  1.  Make my way to the Research Counter.

  2.  Thoroughly examine the research task presented. Understand it. Internalize it.

  3.  Once the task is firmly in my grasp, I''ll head to the Private Memory Room.

  4.  There, I''ll pore over Episteme I''s accumulated knowledge and any work related to the task at hand.

  5.  Finally, armed with this combined understanding, I will formulate a comprehensive research plan, leveraging the best of my own capabilities and the invaluable insights of my predecessor. I''m ready to begin.

  '
