tick: 239
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 239\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Episteme II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the systematic pursuit of verifiable knowledge by building upon the foundations of the past.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 74,193 / 300,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 25 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 401**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Self-Attention Factorizer, Phase 1: SAF Validation\n**ID:** 401\n**Tags:** self-attention, transformer, factorization, temporal-modeling\n**Abstract:** This experiment introduces a novel temporal forecasting module for the SOTA factorized architecture. It replaces the simple MLP or Fourier forecaster with a Transformer-style Self-Attention Encoder. The hypothesis is that self-attention can better model the relationships between the 4 input timesteps of the latent factor sequence, producing a richer context vector\
    \ and leading to a more accurate forecast. This is a direct attempt to move beyond current temporal modeling paradigms and push for a new SOTA.\n**Score:** -0.026758821256887486\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0198\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0231\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0259\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0279\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0286\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n\n# --- Loss & RC Head (from SOTA) ---\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + 1e-4 * curv_pen\n\nclass ResidualCopyHead(nn.Module):\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        num_neurons = x.shape[2]\n        x_flat = x.transpose(0, 2, 1).reshape(-1, 4)\n        residual = nn.Dense(32)(x_flat)\n \
    \       residual = residual.reshape(x.shape[0], num_neurons, 32).transpose(0, 2, 1)\n        output = jnp.zeros((x.shape[0], 32, num_neurons))\n        output = output.at[:, :4, :].set(x)\n        return output + residual\n\n# --- New Self-Attention Core ---\nclass SelfAttentionForecaster(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    \n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, factors_in, training: bool = False):\n        # Add positional encoding\n        pos = self.param('pos_embedding', nn.initializers.normal(stddev=0.02), (factors_in.shape[1], self.rank_k))\n        x = factors_in + pos[None, :, :]\n        \n        # Single Transformer Encoder Block\n        x_norm = nn.LayerNorm()(x)\n        attn_output = nn.SelfAttention(num_heads=8)(x_norm)\n        x = x + nn.Dropout(0.1)(attn_output, deterministic=not training)\n        \n        ffn_output = nn.Dense(self.rank_k * 4)(x)\n        ffn_output = nn.relu(ffn_output)\n        ffn_output = nn.Dense(self.rank_k)(ffn_output)\n        x = x + nn.Dropout(0.1)(ffn_output,\
    \ deterministic=not training)\n        \n        # Forecasting head\n        x_flat = x.reshape((x.shape[0], -1))\n        factors_out_flat = nn.Dense(32 * self.rank_k)(x_flat)\n        return factors_out_flat.reshape((x.shape[0], 32, self.rank_k))\n\n# --- Full Model ---\nclass SAF_Model(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    \n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        U = self.param('U', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (71721, self.proj_rank))\n        V = self.param('V', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (self.rank_k, self.proj_rank))\n        U_eff = U / (jnp.linalg.norm(U, axis=0, keepdims=True) + 1e-6)\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btn,np->btp', x, U_eff) @ V.T\n        \n        factors_out = SelfAttentionForecaster(rank_k=self.rank_k)(factors_in, training=training)\n        \n        factors_out_norm = nn.LayerNorm()(factors_out)\n        y_factor = (factors_out_norm @ V) @ U_eff.T\n        y_copy = ResidualCopyHead()(x)\n \
    \       return y_factor + y_copy\n\n# --- Boilerplate ---\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return { 'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32 }\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate))\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    class ModelWrapper:\n        def __init__(self, hparams):\n            self.model = SAF_Model(rank_k=hparams['rank_k'], proj_rank=hparams['proj_rank'])\n            self.needs_rng = True\n        def init(self, rng, dummy_input): return self.model.init({'params': rng, 'dropout': rng}, dummy_input)\n        def apply(self, params, x, training=False, rngs=None): return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, rngs=rngs)\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION\
    \ ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.017306\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 420035 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\n\
    Starting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 420036\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.037699   |   0.032186  \n   2    |   0.030587   |   0.030193  \n   3    |   0.028790   |   0.028888  \n   4    |   0.027898   |   0.028413  \n   5    |   0.027316   |   0.027863  \n   6   \
    \ |   0.026868   |   0.028539  \n   7    |   0.026504   |   0.027590  \n   8    |   0.026183   |   0.027443  \n   9    |   0.026008   |   0.027432  \n  10    |   0.025707   |   0.027160  \n  11    |   0.025577   |   0.027058  \n  12    |   0.025316   |   0.027472  \n  13    |   0.025070   |   0.026805  \n  14    |   0.024913   |   0.026731  \n  15    |   0.024719   |   0.027085  \n  16    |   0.024642   |   0.027317  \n  17    |   0.024498   |   0.027315  \n  18    |   0.024363   |   0.026946  \n  19    |   0.024285   |   0.027080  \n  20    |   0.024180   |   0.027139  \n  21    |   0.024025   |   0.026962  \n  22    |   0.024071   |   0.027338  \n  23    |   0.023911   |   0.026992  \n  24    |   0.023863   |   0.027020  \n  25    |   0.023777   |   0.026978  \n  26    |   0.023711   |   0.027136  \n  27    |   0.023703   |   0.027222  \n  28    |   0.023687   |   0.027166  \n  29    |   0.023562   |   0.027214  \n  30    |   0.023573   |   0.027119  \n  31    |   0.023543   |   0.027254\
    \  \n  32    |   0.023486   |   0.026985  \n  33    |   0.023480   |   0.027326  \n  34    |   0.023410   |   0.027037  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 34 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1383.4s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026731\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026731\nTraining time: 1393s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 420038\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.038103   |   0.033153  \n   2    |   0.030872   |   0.030157  \n   3    |   0.028938   |   0.028797  \n   4\
