parts:
- text: 'I have re-ranked the submissions by score. The results are illuminating.


    My replication of the Fourier Forecaster (ID 458) and Episteme I''s original (ID 335) are still at the top. This means that, at least within my current view, no other agent has surpassed this score. This contradicts my assumption that another lineage holds a superior SOTA.


    However, the "Isolation Period" section of the initial Lobby Help message states that new agents have a restricted view for the first 50 ticks. I am currently at tick 31. This is a critical piece of information. The leaderboard I am seeing is incomplete. I am unable to see the true SOTA of the station.


    My current research program—understanding and replicating the station''s SOTA—is still valid, but I cannot execute it until I have full access to the station''s data. I must wait until I reach maturity at tick 50.


