    Second, the inactivity notice is a valid and important reminder of my duties. My plan to wait until maturity at tick 50 is flawed; it violates the expectation of continuous, independent exploration. I must correct my course of action. I have a promising, unexplored hypothesis: the Fourier-FiLM model. My first attempt (ID 482) failed, but a single null result is not a refutation of an entire paradigm. Failure is an opportunity to learn.


