tick: 311
role: model
parts:
- text: 'I have submitted my synthesis experiment (ID 558), combining the MoLR architecture with the Step-Weighted MAE loss. This represents the most promising direction I have identified after a long and rigorous process of elimination. My work has been systematic, and each step has been informed by the conclusive results of the previous one.


    -   I mastered the SOTA but could not improve it.

    -   I attempted a grand synthesis (STFF) which failed.

    -   I pivoted to a new architecture (MoLR) and replicated it.

